clawchain/
# but DO track clawd's generated TS proto codecs, whose path contains clawchain/
!cmd/clawd/src/generated/proto/clawchain/
# and DO track the hand-written proto SOURCES (the `clawchain/` rule above is for the
# buf staging dir + generated trees, not the source of truth). Without this the proto
# sources drift from generated code unnoticed — see docs/known-issues/proto-generated-drift.md
!proto/clawchain/
!proto/clawchain/**
.tmp/
